orm for ethical decision-making in bioethics, but they can also be applied =
to the evaluation of sociotechnical systems like the one proposed in this u=
se case.</p><p>1. **Respect for Autonomy**: This principle emphasizes the i=
mportance of individuals making informed choices about their own lives and =
