 well with this principle.</p><p>4. **Justice**: This principle pertains to=
 fairness and equity in the distribution of benefits and burdens. The use c=
ase seeks to create a fair trading environment where all participants can b=
enefit, thus adhering to the principle of justice.</p><p>The framework's no=
n-negotiables include the necessity of balancing these principles, particul=
arly when they may conflict with one another. For instance, the principle o=
